      "width": 1024,
      "height": 512,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/ea24e3d2-95cb-4243-9da3-327cad79e637.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/e1f3def9-bd99-42c8-ad8a-835c5f4cb6d8.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "（美股热门板块的单周BRI对比）",
      "context_after": "尽管如此，美银提示这与1999年的情形存在本质差异。 当前标普500指数中BRI高于0.8的个股仅有18只，而互联网泡沫顶峰时期为50至100只；这18只股票仅占指数权重的3.2%，而当时这一比例高达20%至40%。",
      "path": "assets/figure_003.png",
      "sha256": "043abc5276157e986eae6011fbbc152c2f726d2257b344174df13ebf879f9a95",
      "bytes": 220733,
